  stop the animations
    → tofu settings set animations off
  show every tool call in the chat
    → tofu settings set chatShowsTools true
  hide the model's thinking
    → tofu settings set showThinking false
  pick the model a sub-agent tier runs
    → tofu settings set modelTier.smart claude-sub/claude-sonnet-5
  change a setting for one project only
    → tofu settings set --scope project <key> <value>
  move old sessions out of the project
    → tofu migrate
  update tofu to the latest release
    → tofu update
  change what a rule tofu ships says, for this project
    → tofu rules add <id> "<text>" --reason "<why>"
  run the next task on another model
    → /models in the app, then pick a model
  always run the orchestrator on one model
    → tofu models bind orchestrator claude-sub/claude-sonnet-5
  pick the model every sub-agent runs
    → tofu models bind sub-agent claude-sub/claude-sonnet-5
  why the quota reading is stale or how old it is
    → tofu usage
  see which skills the model is offered
    → tofu run --dir . --show-prompt "anything"
  write a map of my project's folders
    → /generate-map in the app, then answer yes to write MAP.md
  propose a cleaner structure for my project
    → /restructure in the app, then reshape the tree it proposes in your own words
  store the typesafe key the gate needs
    → tofu login classifier typesafe
  bind the classifier the gate runs
    → tofu models bind classifier typesafe/jev-latest
  work one task with the gate off
    → tofu run --dir . --no-gate "<task>"
  see how full the context window got
    → tofu context
  free room in the context before the next turn
    → /compact in the app, between turns
  undo what the last turn changed
    → tofu undo, or /undo in the app
  read the output of a running shell
    → tofu shells log <name>
  see what agents left in the scratchpad
    → tofu scratch
  clean the scratchpad
    → tofu scratch clean
  see what other sessions asked the board for
    → tofu boardy triage list
  sum up the board
    → tofu boardy report --since 7d
  see the Claude Code and codex hooks tofu runs here
    → tofu hooks
  check the library files and these pages
    → tofu library
  let the model read the Chrome tabs tofu can reach
    → tofu settings set browser read
  let the model click and type in the tabs tofu can reach
    → tofu settings set browser drive
  take the browser tools away from the model
    → tofu settings set browser off
  let jev pick each browser step toward a whole goal instead of the model
    → tofu settings set browserDriver goal
  repeat a prompt every few minutes
    → /loop 10m check the build
  keep working until a test passes
    → /goal make the test pass --until "go test ./..."
  find a prompt I sent in another session
    → ctrl+p in the app, type part of it, then enter
  check a commit message the way the git hook does
    → tofu guard git commit-msg .git/COMMIT_EDITMSG
  run one tool call by hand and see what the model would read
    → tofu tool read '{"path":"README.md"}' --dir .
  run the tests of one package and see only what failed
    → tofu tool test '{"path":"."}' --dir .
  check a report against the calls the session made
    → tofu tool claims '{"report":"All tests pass."}' --dir . --session head
  which turn made this change, and put it back
    → tofu tool trail '{"mode":"find","anchor":"handling fee"}' --dir .
  which turn broke the tests
    → tofu tool bisect '{"check":"test","name":"TestTotal"}' --dir .
  see the values on one call of a function without print lines
    → tofu tool debug '{"steps":["start test TestTill","break till.go:14 --if t.rung == 3","run","eval cents","stop"]}' --dir .
  rewrite one code shape everywhere without touching strings
    → tofu tool codemod '{"lang":"go","pattern":"t.Fatalf($$$ARGS)","rewrite":"t.Errorf($$$ARGS)"}' --dir .
  make a new file shaped like an existing one
    → tofu tool scaffold '{"kind":"type","name":"Invoice","like":"order.go"}' --dir .
  add a dependency after checking its license and advisories
    → tofu tool deps '{"mode":"add","package":"github.com/google/uuid"}' --dir .
  which dependencies have a newer release
    → tofu tool deps '{"mode":"outdated"}' --dir .
  which tools does the review agent get
    → tofu tool list --agent review
  read the lines around one function
    → tofu tool read '{"path":"order.go","at":"Total"}' --dir .
  what else must change if I change this type
    → tofu tool symbols '{"name":"Order","mode":"impact"}' --dir .
  what does this dependency look like at the version we pinned
    → tofu tool api '{"package":"github.com/pelletier/go-toml/v2","name":"NewDecoder"}' --dir .
  see what is in the project database without writing to it
    → tofu tool db '{"env":"DATABASE_URL"}' --dir .
  try two approaches at once and keep the one that passes
    → tofu docs tools
  tell me something during a turn without stopping it
    → tofu tool heads_up '{"level":"info","line":"the full test run takes about two minutes"}' --dir .
  what does the model see filling its own window
    → tofu tool context '{}' --dir . --session head
  let the model ask a cheap model about one long result
    → tofu settings set modelTier.dumb <source/model>
  fork the conversation now and start a fresh line
    → /fork in the app
  branch from one of my earlier messages and keep the old line
    → /branch in the app to list your messages, then /branch N
  open a side chat beside the session
    → /side in the app
  take back an always or never answer I gave
    → /permissions in the app, then /permissions revoke <n>
  read a session as a transcript, the way people read it
    → tofu session transcript <name|id|head>
  continue a session from the command line as its next turn
    → tofu run --dir . --session <name|id|head> "<task>"
  why did the host stop, crash or freeze
    → tofu session trace <name|id|head> --kind stop
  check each plan the lead sets against what I asked
    → tofu settings set planAdvisor shadow
  stop the plan advisor
    → tofu settings set planAdvisor off
  keep what I asked word for word, with the tickets cut from it
    → tofu boardy request new "<your words>" --tickets <A,B>
  record a before capture of how things work before a change
    → tofu boardy log <id> --before "<what you ran and what it printed>"
  name the skills a ticket's sub-agent loads
    → tofu boardy set <id> --skills <a,b>
  load a skill when my message says certain words
    → write trigger: auto and keywords: <a>, <b> in the skill's SKILL.md
  turn off a skill that loaded on my words
    → /skill off <name> in the app
  drive the desk app and keep its screenshots
    → tofu drive desk --out <dir>
  drive the app with no terminal and no model call
    → tofu drive <script> --plain
  I am away, keep working without asking me
    → tell the lead you are leaving; it calls cron with action away
  I am back, ask me again
    → tell the lead you are back; it calls cron with action back
  how long will this work take
    → ask the lead; it answers with estimate_time
  how long until a running sub-agent finishes
    → ask the lead; it calls estimate_time with the sub-agent's id
  close a question without choosing and answer it later
    → pick return, the last row of the form
  why did my session fork, and how full is the context
    → tofu context
